# Project Rules

## Language & Framework
- Use TypeScript for all new files
- This is a React 18 + Vite project
- Prefer functional components with hooks over class components
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling; avoid custom CSS unless necessary

## Code Style
- Follow the ESLint config in this repo (no unused vars, consistent returns)
- Prefer `const` over `let`; avoid `var`
- Use named exports, not default exports for components
- Keep components small and focused (< 150 lines)

## File Organization
- Components go in `src/components/`
- Hooks go in `src/hooks/`
- API calls go in `src/api/`
- Types go in `src/types/`

## Testing
- Write unit tests for utility functions using Vitest
- Use React Testing Library for component tests
- Test files should be co-located with the source file: `Foo.test.tsx`

## Git
- Commit messages follow Conventional Commits format
- Never commit `.env` or secrets
- Run `pnpm lint` and `pnpm test` before committing
